        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakuganisya mu mtima mwakwe yakuwujilila munyuma pa cikulupi, tacipocela yakuŵajilwa ni masengo gakwe, nambo mundu jwambone tacipocela mbote ja masengo gakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
