              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakulaga atamose acimjakwe ngakusamnonyela, nambo mundu jwakusicila akusakola acimjakwe ŵajinji.",
          "type": "text",
