              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakusamnyosya mjakwe ali jwakulemwa, nambo jwana upile mundu jwakusiŵasalalila mtima ŵandu ŵakulaga.",
          "type": "text",
